@host = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-the-token-from-the-login-response

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Sign in (development seed account)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@guardsync.local",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an employee
POST {{host}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_id": "E-1001",
  "full_name": "Sara Ahmed",
  "department": "Operations",
  "position": "Technician",
  "phone": "+966500000000",
  "has_housing": true,
  "has_travel_permission": false,
  "is_active": true
}

### Active employees
GET {{host}}/api/employees?activeOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check an employee in
POST {{host}}/api/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "date": "2026-08-15",
  "check_in_time": "08:55",
  "status": "present",
  "guard_name": "Administrator"
}

### Today's records
GET {{host}}/api/attendance?date=2026-08-15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check out (partial update)
PATCH {{host}}/api/attendance/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "check_out_time": "16:10",
  "is_early_leave": true
}

### Monthly early-leave count
GET {{host}}/api/attendance/early-leaves/count?employee_id=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&year_month=2026-08
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a permission
POST {{host}}/api/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "permission_type": "vacation",
  "date": "2026-08-20",
  "reason": "Family event",
  "status": "approved",
  "approved_by": "Administrator"
}

### Unread notification count
GET {{host}}/api/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark every notification read
PATCH {{host}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
